title: Optional workflow machinery
pid: 4b5f172f-f611-4d9a-a832-6ec9c8c95b11
body: |2-
  Read [[id:3bbbf49e-8e61-4b55-beb2-221b2ff634b3][file:optional-workflows.org]] only when considering its quiet test
  wrapper, delegation, or long-task ledger. It explains which process choices
  need Jeff's agreement. An explicitly relevant archived reference can be
  read on its own without loading the rest of 'maybe-obsolete/'.
